source: crates/standalone/fixture/src/lib.rs
---
Claim, prove, rotate, list and release the site's repository.

Usage: ink repo <COMMAND>

Commands
  claim    Ask to prove the site's repository
  prove    Read the forge and bind the repository to the site
  rotate   Put a new webhook secret in place of the old
  list     The site's repositories
  release  Let go of a repository and delete its secret

Global  -C, --json, -q, -v, --color, --no-progress, --log, --log-file
        (see `ink --help`)
More    ink repo --help adds examples, notes and exit codes
